OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will remain cloudy
OL,6,Fthroughout the day with outbreaks of
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy rain and fresh
OL,8,Fnortheast to northerly winds. Winds
OL,9,Feasing for a time over Orkney with
OL,10,Fsome haar developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA cloudy evening with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of heavy rain. It will
OL,14,Fremain cloudy overnight but the rain
OL,15,Fwill slowly ease off. Strong northerly
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FA day of bright spells and
OL,19,Fscattered showers. Strong north or
OL,20,Fnorthwesterly winds will ease.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
